{"seq":2,"slug":"non-autoregressive-tts","title":"非自回归与混合语音合成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/non-autoregressive-tts","wordCount":1225,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"非自回归与混合语音合成模型\">非自回归与混合语音合成模型</h1><p>自回归模型通过逐 token 生成实现了极高的自然度，但其串行解码本质决定了推理速度受限于序列长度。非自回归（Non-Autoregressive, NAR）模型和 AR+NAR 混合架构则在质量与速度之间寻找新的帕累托前沿。2024-2026 年间，Flow Matching 和扩散模型成为 NAR TTS 的主力方法，而 MaskGCT、NaturalSpeech 3 等混合架构证明了两种范式可以互补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>非自回归（NAR）</strong>：并行生成所有时间步的 token，把推理复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，以部分质量换取极低延迟</li>\n<li><strong>Flow Matching</strong>：学习一个向量场把先验分布沿最优传输路径映射到数据分布，训练目标比 DDPM 更简单、推理步数更少</li>\n<li><strong>分解式子空间</strong>：NaturalSpeech 3 把语音拆为内容 / 韵律 / 音色 / 细节四个子空间，各用独立模型处理，实现维度级独立控制</li>\n<li><strong>掩码预测范式</strong>：MaskGCT 用多轮迭代解码，将低置信度 token 重新 mask 再预测</li>\n<li><strong>AR+NAR 混合</strong>：AR 保证语义一致性，NAR 负责高效声学生成，是工业界主流架构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要非自回归\">为什么需要非自回归</h2><p>自回归 TTS 的推理成本与输出长度成正比——10 秒语音在 75Hz 帧率下需要 750 步解码。对于实时交互场景（语音助手、同传），这带来高延迟和高算力成本。NAR 模型通过并行生成所有时间步的 token，将推理从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>推理复杂度</th>\n<th>生成质量</th>\n<th>典型延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯 AR</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯 NAR</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AR+NAR 混合</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sem</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(T_{\\text{sem}}) + O(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"flow-matching-nar-的新主力\">Flow Matching：NAR 的新主力</h2><p>Flow Matching（2023-2024）迅速成为 NAR TTS 的首选生成框架。其核心思想是学习一个向量场 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，将简单先验分布沿最优传输路径映射到数据分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d\\mathbf{z}_t}{dt} = v_\\theta(\\mathbf{z}_t, t, \\mathbf{c}), \\quad t \\in [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是条件信息（文本编码、说话人嵌入）。相比 DDPM 风格的扩散模型，Flow Matching 训练目标更简单、推理步数更少（10-30 步）、路径更直。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[文本编码 + 说话人条件] --&gt; B[条件 Flow Matching]&#10;    B --&gt; C[ODE 求解&lt;br/&gt;10-30 步]&#10;    C --&gt; D[连续声学特征]&#10;    D --&gt; E[HiFi-GAN / Codec Decoder]&#10;    E --&gt; F[波形输出]&#10;    G[高斯噪声] --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n    A[文本编码 + 说话人条件] --&gt; B[条件 Flow Matching]\n    B --&gt; C[ODE 求解&lt;br/&gt;10-30 步]\n    C --&gt; D[连续声学特征]\n    D --&gt; E[HiFi-GAN / Codec Decoder]\n    E --&gt; F[波形输出]\n    G[高斯噪声] --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"代表模型-e2-tts-与-f5-tts\">代表模型：E2 TTS 与 F5-TTS</h2><p><strong>E2 TTS（Microsoft, 2024）</strong>：「Embarrassingly Easy」TTS——用纯 Flow Matching 模型直接从文本生成 Mel 频谱。核心创新是填充式生成：将文本和语音拼接在同一序列中，用 mask 标记需要生成的部分。</p>\n<p><strong>F5-TTS（2024）</strong>：在 E2 TTS 基础上引入 DiT（Diffusion Transformer）架构替换 U-Net，关键改进包括文本时长通过 filler token 对齐到语音帧数、DiT 的 AdaLN-Zero 条件注入、无需对齐器或时长预测器。</p>\n<p><strong>Magpie TTS Flow（NVIDIA Riva, 2025）</strong>：将 HuBERT 离散单元融入 Flow Matching 训练框架，实现对齐感知预训练。即使在低资源语言上也能保持高质量合成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"naturalspeech-系列\">NaturalSpeech 系列</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>核心方法</th>\n<th>创新点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NaturalSpeech (2022)</td>\n<td>VAE + Flow</td>\n<td>首个在 LJSpeech 达到人类水平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NaturalSpeech 2 (2023)</td>\n<td>潜在扩散模型</td>\n<td>在连续潜空间上做扩散，零样本能力强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NaturalSpeech 3 (2024)</td>\n<td>分解扩散</td>\n<td>将语音分解为内容/韵律/音色/细节四个子空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>NaturalSpeech 3 的分解式子空间扩散将复杂生成问题分解为四个简单的条件生成，每个子空间用独立的 Flow Matching 模型处理，使各维度可以独立控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"maskgct-掩码预测范式\">MaskGCT：掩码预测范式</h2><p>MaskGCT（字节跳动，2024）将 Masked Language Model 范式引入 TTS：第一阶段用 masked prediction 生成语义 token，第二阶段用 masked prediction 生成声学 token。每阶段支持多轮迭代解码——首轮低置信度的 token 在后续轮次被重新 mask 并重新预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ar-nar-混合架构\">AR+NAR 混合架构</h2><p>当前最强的 TTS 系统几乎都是混合架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Stage 1 AR&quot;&#10;        A[文本] --&gt; B[Transformer AR&lt;br/&gt;生成语义 Token]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Stage 2 NAR&quot;&#10;        B --&gt; C[Flow Matching&lt;br/&gt;语义到声学]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Stage 3 Decoder&quot;&#10;        C --&gt; D[Codec Decoder&lt;br/&gt;波形重建]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"Stage 1 AR\"\n        A[文本] --&gt; B[Transformer AR&lt;br/&gt;生成语义 Token]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Stage 2 NAR\"\n        B --&gt; C[Flow Matching&lt;br/&gt;语义到声学]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Stage 3 Decoder\"\n        C --&gt; D[Codec Decoder&lt;br/&gt;波形重建]\n    end</pre><p>代表系统：CosyVoice（阿里，AR 语义 + Flow Matching 声学）、Seed-TTS（字节，AR 语义 + 扩散声学）、VibeVoice TTS（微软，AR 文本到语义 + 扩散生成 90 分钟连续语音）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"速度-质量权衡的量化\">速度-质量权衡的量化</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>RTF (GPU)</th>\n<th>MOS</th>\n<th>首包延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VALL-E 2</td>\n<td>纯 AR</td>\n<td>~2.0</td>\n<td>4.2</td>\n<td>&gt;500ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F5-TTS</td>\n<td>纯 NAR (FM)</td>\n<td>~0.15</td>\n<td>4.0</td>\n<td>&lt;200ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CosyVoice 2</td>\n<td>AR+FM</td>\n<td>~0.5</td>\n<td>4.1</td>\n<td>~300ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fish Audio S2</td>\n<td>AR+FM</td>\n<td>0.195</td>\n<td>4.1</td>\n<td>&lt;100ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MaskGCT</td>\n<td>Masked</td>\n<td>~0.3</td>\n<td>4.0</td>\n<td>~250ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>NAR 模型通过并行生成突破 AR 的串行瓶颈</li>\n<li>Flow Matching 以更简单的训练目标和更少的推理步数取代 DDPM</li>\n<li>NaturalSpeech 3 的分解式子空间设计实现维度级可控</li>\n<li>MaskGCT 将 masked prediction 范式引入 TTS，支持迭代精修</li>\n<li>AR+NAR 混合是工业界主流：AR 管语义一致性，NAR 管高效声学生成</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"autoregressive-tts\">自回归语音合成模型</a> —— 混合架构的 AR 侧详细原理</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../computer-vision-applied/generation/diffusion-models\">扩散模型</a> —— Flow Matching 的图像域对应物与共同理论基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"非自回归与混合语音合成模型","id":"非自回归与混合语音合成模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要非自回归","id":"为什么需要非自回归"},{"level":2,"text":"Flow Matching：NAR 的新主力","id":"flow-matching-nar-的新主力"},{"level":2,"text":"代表模型：E2 TTS 与 F5-TTS","id":"代表模型-e2-tts-与-f5-tts"},{"level":2,"text":"NaturalSpeech 系列","id":"naturalspeech-系列"},{"level":2,"text":"MaskGCT：掩码预测范式","id":"maskgct-掩码预测范式"},{"level":2,"text":"AR+NAR 混合架构","id":"ar-nar-混合架构"},{"level":2,"text":"速度-质量权衡的量化","id":"速度-质量权衡的量化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"自回归语音合成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/autoregressive-tts"},"next":{"title":"语音编辑模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/speech-editing-models"}}